1
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:29,880
YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!

2
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,620
Your moves!

3
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:05,860
I'm almost to Pegasus' castle.

4
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:07,657
I've got to be on my guard.

5
00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:11,620
His goons are everywhere, but
they won't stop me. Nothing will.

6
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:17,148
Mokuba's life's at stake, and nothing's
more important than my little brother.

7
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:22,280
After our parents died, I promised I'd
always take care of him, and I will.

8
00:01:22,660 --> 00:01:26,000
He's always looked up to me,
and I won't disappoint him.

9
00:01:26,660 --> 00:01:28,520
Not now, not ever.

10
00:01:29,340 --> 00:01:33,940
So it's the famous Seto Kaiba Searching
for your little brother, no doubt

11
00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:36,740
You're coming with me

12
00:01:43,740 --> 00:01:45,920
Actually, you're coming with me

13
00:01:49,980 --> 00:01:53,897
You're gonna help me find
Mokuba Wherever Pegasus has

14
00:01:53,980 --> 00:01:57,680
him And you're gonna start by
getting me into that castle

15
00:02:00,420 --> 00:02:04,600
With our trap, you stopped our
attack Just as you did Pledge,

16
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:08,880
but with our scores Ahead of
yours, we still have the edge

17
00:02:14,700 --> 00:02:16,260
We're just getting started

18
00:02:18,420 --> 00:02:19,250
Hmm,

19
00:02:19,333 --> 00:02:20,817
so far the only monster
I got in the field is

20
00:02:20,900 --> 00:02:23,724
my Axe Raider I need to
bolster our attack force

21
00:02:27,720 --> 00:02:30,360
Now, my Flame Swordsman
will heat things up.

22
00:02:30,980 --> 00:02:32,840
I put it in attack mode.

23
00:02:35,980 --> 00:02:39,274
Its power level is five, but
I'll move only four spaces.

24
00:02:40,760 --> 00:02:42,937
I'll also move Axe Raider forward four

25
00:02:43,020 --> 00:02:45,726
spaces to join him and
consolidate our forces.

26
00:02:46,320 --> 00:02:49,379
I've already used up Kunai
with Chain's Trap Effect,

27
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:51,737
but it still works as a
regular accessory card,

28
00:02:51,820 --> 00:02:54,644
raising Axe Raider's
attack power by 500 points.

29
00:02:56,660 --> 00:02:59,248
Let's see you take that
on you twisted twins

30
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:03,997
It doesn't matter if your
forces are one or many For soon

31
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:08,080
There won't be any Labyrinth
tank Advance seven more spaces

32
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:13,397
Labyrinth tank wields futuristic
weaponry Your archaic soldiers

33
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:16,197
don't stand a chance And soon
they will be within striking

34
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:19,677
range And somewhere in the
labyrinth Lurks another trap for

35
00:03:19,760 --> 00:03:23,289
your unwary warriors Do you
really think you stand a chance?

36
00:03:23,860 --> 00:03:27,280
Don't you two ever stop
yacking. You're up, Yugi.

37
00:03:27,720 --> 00:03:31,920
Then I play Dark Magician in attack mode.

38
00:03:34,740 --> 00:03:38,280
I move him forward five spaces
to defend our other warriors.

39
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,190
Cool.

40
00:03:42,273 --> 00:03:43,103
Nice move, Yugi.

41
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,617
Now the gang's all here.

42
00:03:44,700 --> 00:03:47,171
They're a team, just like you and me, pal.

43
00:03:47,340 --> 00:03:48,170
Right, Joey.

44
00:03:48,253 --> 00:03:49,377
There's strength in numbers.

45
00:03:49,460 --> 00:03:53,931
Together, they stand a much better
chance of conquering this murderous maze.

46
00:03:54,700 --> 00:03:56,640
We shall see about that.

47
00:03:58,600 --> 00:04:01,260
Quit grinning and spit it out. What is it?

48
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:05,960
It's a magic card, and that's cause
for celebration, brother. Right!

49
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:12,837
Now face the wall-warping power of...

50
00:04:12,920 --> 00:04:14,660
Magical Labyrinth!

51
00:04:17,300 --> 00:04:18,437
What's going on?

52
00:04:18,520 --> 00:04:19,580
The maze.

53
00:04:19,820 --> 00:04:20,800
It's changing.

54
00:04:21,220 --> 00:04:23,360
And that changes the whole game.

55
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:29,660
Oh, no.

56
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:31,428
The maze is changing shape.

57
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:33,226
Yeah, but what's it all mean?

58
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:36,760
That's just great.

59
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:39,496
Our guys are cut off from each other.

60
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:44,520
That's the power of the magical labyrinth.

61
00:04:44,620 --> 00:04:46,837
To reshape the maze according to our will.

62
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:48,640
That should rattle them.

63
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:51,857
Tag teams are only as strong
as their weakest link.

64
00:04:51,940 --> 00:04:54,197
And the link that's about to break is you.

65
00:04:54,280 --> 00:04:55,110
Oh, no.

66
00:04:55,193 --> 00:04:56,055
Our strategy's blown.

67
00:04:56,220 --> 00:04:58,102
Don't let them rattle you, Joey.

68
00:04:58,860 --> 00:04:59,690
Huh?

69
00:04:59,773 --> 00:05:00,603
Right, Uke.

70
00:05:00,900 --> 00:05:02,200
Gotta keep calm.

71
00:05:03,300 --> 00:05:06,580
Axe Raider, Flame Swordsman,
advance and regroup.

72
00:05:06,940 --> 00:05:11,840
The closer our boys get to the maze exit,
the closer we get to getting out of here.

73
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:15,977
Wait! Joey, look out! Too late.

74
00:05:16,060 --> 00:05:18,980
He activated my trap. What?

75
00:05:19,460 --> 00:05:22,225
And now the landmine
spider attacks Axe Raider.

76
00:05:26,020 --> 00:05:27,740
Fend him off, Axe Raider.

77
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:29,940
He's too weak.

78
00:05:30,180 --> 00:05:34,062
Jirai Kumo reduces Axe Raider's
attack power to its original 1700.

79
00:05:34,420 --> 00:05:35,250
That means...

80
00:05:35,640 --> 00:05:37,960
Your Axe Raider is vanquished.

81
00:05:38,280 --> 00:05:40,700
And you lose 400 life points.

82
00:05:42,540 --> 00:05:44,437
400 points? You're right.

83
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:46,696
Joey just walked right into that one.

84
00:05:47,180 --> 00:05:48,680
Good trap, my brother.

85
00:05:49,880 --> 00:05:51,409
That's just the beginning.

86
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:54,180
Labyrinth tank, advance seven more.

87
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:58,100
And then I'll lay one more card.

88
00:05:58,400 --> 00:05:59,700
In defense mode.

89
00:06:01,620 --> 00:06:03,914
Aren't you going to tell us what it is?

90
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:08,320
You have enough to worry about.

91
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:12,377
My labyrinth tank is now within striking
distance of your flame swordsman.

92
00:06:12,460 --> 00:06:14,677
It's all over for him in the next turn.

93
00:06:14,760 --> 00:06:18,407
Then you can worry about what
other surprises I have in store.

94
00:06:20,620 --> 00:06:22,020
This doesn't look good.

95
00:06:22,260 --> 00:06:23,400
Tell me about it.

96
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:25,541
It's a good thing Yugi's up next.

97
00:06:31,580 --> 00:06:32,780
We'll counterattack.

98
00:06:33,100 --> 00:06:37,960
I play the Magic Card Mystic Box in
combination with the Dark Magician.

99
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:42,320
I seal my Dark Magician
within the first Mystic Box.

100
00:06:42,460 --> 00:06:45,360
as swords rain from the sky.

101
00:06:45,760 --> 00:06:46,880
Hmm, what's this?

102
00:06:51,260 --> 00:06:54,620
The duelist's gone mad,
sacrificing his own monster.

103
00:06:54,860 --> 00:06:56,240
No way, look. Huh?

104
00:06:57,080 --> 00:07:00,540
Another box materializing
around my dear eye, Kubo.

105
00:07:05,020 --> 00:07:05,850
Ah!

106
00:07:07,540 --> 00:07:09,480
My spider is cured.

107
00:07:11,580 --> 00:07:14,700
and his Dark Magician is unharmed!

108
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:16,350
Right.

109
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:20,697
My Dark Magician magically switched
his position with that of your monster,

110
00:07:20,780 --> 00:07:25,280
trapping him in the first Mystic
Box and ending my magic act.

111
00:07:26,220 --> 00:07:27,057
All right.

112
00:07:27,140 --> 00:07:28,960
Let's see Q-Ball top that.

113
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:30,870
Hmm.

114
00:07:30,953 --> 00:07:31,783
And now for his tank.

115
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:34,640
Dark Magician, Dark Magic Attack!

116
00:07:43,660 --> 00:07:46,307
Let's see what that does
to your life points.

117
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:52,929
Together, Joey and I will overcome any
obstacles that you two put in our way.

118
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:56,160
You have security clearance. Open it.

119
00:07:56,300 --> 00:07:58,277
Don't you think we should ring the bell?

120
00:07:58,360 --> 00:08:01,017
I think you should shut your
mouth and open the door.

121
00:08:01,100 --> 00:08:01,930
Open it now.

122
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:06,700
You do know no one takes
Pegasus by surprise.

123
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:10,080
He probably already knows
you're here. Somehow.

124
00:08:16,100 --> 00:08:17,160
Big Brother.

125
00:08:19,140 --> 00:08:20,300
Where are you?

126
00:08:23,280 --> 00:08:26,660
Okay, Dumbo Duo, now we're
gonna clean your clocks.

127
00:08:26,960 --> 00:08:28,842
Of yourself, you think too much.

128
00:08:28,980 --> 00:08:31,098
Show them, Brother, our lucky touch.

129
00:08:37,680 --> 00:08:40,080
I don't like it when that goon grins.

130
00:08:40,740 --> 00:08:45,077
Sanga of Thunder is one of three gods
that control thunder, wind, and water.

131
00:08:45,160 --> 00:08:50,180
The remaining two cards are Sui-Gene,
God of Water, and Kazi-Gene, God of Wind.

132
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:53,833
If our luck holds two more
turns and we acquire them all,

133
00:08:53,940 --> 00:08:56,822
they can be combined to
create the Gate Guardian.

134
00:08:57,700 --> 00:08:59,420
Quit your mumbling, no hair.

135
00:08:59,660 --> 00:09:01,013
Just hurry up and move.

136
00:09:01,380 --> 00:09:02,480
Not so hasty.

137
00:09:02,660 --> 00:09:05,425
I will lay this card face
down, ending my turn.

138
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:11,950
Intriguing, eh?

139
00:09:12,033 --> 00:09:13,253
What could be in there?

140
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:18,577
I don't know, but we'll bust it open
and find out when our guys get there.

141
00:09:18,660 --> 00:09:22,900
Flame swordsman, advance five more
spaces toward the end of the maze.

142
00:09:25,060 --> 00:09:26,680
We're almost there, Yu-Gi.

143
00:09:28,180 --> 00:09:30,737
I can't let them escape
the maze until we've

144
00:09:30,820 --> 00:09:32,737
assembled all the pieces of the Guardian.

145
00:09:32,820 --> 00:09:34,173
Now we'll test my luck.

146
00:09:35,800 --> 00:09:37,420
Sui-Gi, the Water God.

147
00:09:37,740 --> 00:09:39,916
Looks like I've doubled our delights.

148
00:09:45,400 --> 00:09:47,120
Another Chinese box.

149
00:09:47,580 --> 00:09:48,880
What could they be?

150
00:09:50,160 --> 00:09:52,337
I've got a bad feeling about those boxes.

151
00:09:52,420 --> 00:09:55,440
I sense something ancient and evil.

152
00:09:55,820 --> 00:10:00,220
It's like I can feel a powerful,
dangerous energy pulsating inside them.

153
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:05,600
We cannot summon the Gatekeeper yet, but
we can still slow our enemies' advance.

154
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:08,880
I now play my hidden card.

155
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:12,640
Dungeon Wurf, return to the
surface now in attack mode.

156
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:17,769
And I will strengthen
it with Invigoration,

157
00:10:17,880 --> 00:10:21,160
which raises its attack
power by 400 points.

158
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:23,540
What is that beast? Huh?

159
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:26,113
It's a burrower and it's coming for you.

160
00:10:27,260 --> 00:10:28,090
Where'd it go?

161
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:29,769
Where's that thing hiding?

162
00:10:32,400 --> 00:10:33,230
No!

163
00:10:34,660 --> 00:10:35,490
No!

164
00:10:35,573 --> 00:10:36,678
My Celtic Guardian!

165
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:42,180
Watch your life points go slithering away.

166
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:45,800
Hey, that's not fair.

167
00:10:45,980 --> 00:10:47,857
That creature can pop up any place.

168
00:10:47,940 --> 00:10:48,770
That's true.

169
00:10:48,853 --> 00:10:51,157
This field gives their
monsters all the advantage.

170
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:52,070
That's right.

171
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:53,866
No one escapes the labyrinth.

172
00:10:54,400 --> 00:10:55,576
It's up to you, Yug.

173
00:10:55,700 --> 00:10:58,517
You're gonna have to pull
a winner out of your hat.

174
00:10:58,600 --> 00:10:59,440
Great idea.

175
00:10:59,920 --> 00:11:01,600
I play magical hats.

176
00:11:01,820 --> 00:11:03,340
Hats, materialize!

177
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:06,580
As for our warriors, now you see them...

178
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:10,200
Now you don't.

179
00:11:11,940 --> 00:11:13,000
Oh, the hats!

180
00:11:13,140 --> 00:11:15,517
They're multiplying,
hiding all their monsters.

181
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:16,430
All right, Yug.

182
00:11:16,513 --> 00:11:18,777
That should sure confuse
that slimy worm of theirs.

183
00:11:18,860 --> 00:11:21,801
And the dungeon worm's
attack power is only 2,200,

184
00:11:21,980 --> 00:11:24,039
while the Dark Magician's is 2,500.

185
00:11:24,500 --> 00:11:28,117
So if the worm chooses the wrong
hat and uncovers the Dark Magician,

186
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:29,788
he'll only destroy himself.

187
00:11:32,040 --> 00:11:35,099
And that guarantees your
swordsman's safety as well.

188
00:11:35,460 --> 00:11:40,166
Because with the Dark Magician lying in
wait, the worm dare not strike any hats.

189
00:11:40,500 --> 00:11:43,794
Your little plan is not as
foolproof as you think, Yugi!

190
00:11:45,020 --> 00:11:48,020
Monster Tamer, appear now in attack mode!

191
00:11:51,520 --> 00:11:52,350
Hmm?

192
00:11:52,433 --> 00:11:53,500
The monster tamer?

193
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:55,280
Ha! Normally,

194
00:11:55,460 --> 00:11:57,277
I couldn't control the dungeon worm or any

195
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:59,577
other monster my brother
placed on the field.

196
00:11:59,660 --> 00:12:01,857
But by using this monster tamer,

197
00:12:01,940 --> 00:12:06,037
I can add 600 points to the
dungeon worm's attack power and

198
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:09,944
also make the worm follow my
tamer's instructions during my turn.

199
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:12,577
Oh, 2,800.

200
00:12:12,660 --> 00:12:16,877
That raises the dungeon worm's attack
power higher than the dark magicians.

201
00:12:16,960 --> 00:12:18,600
Now, Monster Tamer,

202
00:12:18,900 --> 00:12:22,841
command my brother's dungeon worm
to destroy one of the magic hats!

203
00:12:23,300 --> 00:12:26,377
With their dungeon worm powered
up by the Monster Tamer,

204
00:12:26,460 --> 00:12:28,107
this all comes down to luck.

205
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:31,160
Empty hat.

206
00:12:31,820 --> 00:12:33,460
Oh, that was close.

207
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:41,117
Luck was with us this time, but the
dungeon worm will attack again next turn.

208
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:45,494
And then, with only one empty hat
remaining, the odds will be against us.

209
00:12:45,820 --> 00:12:47,680
What can we do? Don't sweat it.

210
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:49,740
I got it all figured out.

211
00:12:49,900 --> 00:12:53,312
You just sit back and watch
me and the flame swordsman go.

212
00:12:55,480 --> 00:12:56,897
Joey, what are you doing?

213
00:12:56,980 --> 00:12:58,220
Is Joey nuts?

214
00:12:58,340 --> 00:12:59,693
His swordsman was safe.

215
00:13:00,300 --> 00:13:01,130
Don't worry.

216
00:13:01,213 --> 00:13:02,517
This time I know what I'm doing.

217
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:04,860
I played a magic card. Salamandra!

218
00:13:06,480 --> 00:13:07,310
That's right.

219
00:13:07,420 --> 00:13:08,477
You ought to be scared.

220
00:13:08,560 --> 00:13:12,442
It juices up any fire-based blade
and raises its attack point 700.

221
00:13:13,740 --> 00:13:15,799
Swordsman, Salamander Flametstrike.

222
00:13:18,900 --> 00:13:21,220
Where is it going? Good show.

223
00:13:21,380 --> 00:13:24,757
Not only does Salamander increase
the swordsman's attack strength,

224
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:26,977
but because of the
worm's weakness to fire,

225
00:13:27,060 --> 00:13:30,537
it negates the bonus points the
worm got from the monster tamer,

226
00:13:30,620 --> 00:13:32,980
returning its attack power to 2200.

227
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:36,400
Less than my supercharged
swordsman, the worm turns.

228
00:13:36,620 --> 00:13:38,280
Or should I say burns?

229
00:13:38,800 --> 00:13:39,630
Top that.

230
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:40,840
Joey, great move.

231
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:41,830
Good going.

232
00:13:41,913 --> 00:13:42,743
You did it!

233
00:13:43,300 --> 00:13:46,060
You must draw the card we need! Indeed!

234
00:13:47,940 --> 00:13:48,770
Ha!

235
00:13:48,853 --> 00:13:49,701
The third piece!

236
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:51,369
This will seal their fate!

237
00:13:51,640 --> 00:13:52,817
The third piece!

238
00:13:52,900 --> 00:13:54,417
With which we'll now create!

239
00:13:54,500 --> 00:13:55,760
A monster who will...

240
00:13:56,340 --> 00:13:57,170
Annihilate!

241
00:13:59,820 --> 00:14:00,650
Against...

242
00:14:00,733 --> 00:14:01,563
The Trinity!

243
00:14:01,646 --> 00:14:02,476
They can't defend!

244
00:14:02,640 --> 00:14:04,617
All their life points we will rend!

245
00:14:04,700 --> 00:14:06,920
Summon Kazajin, God of Wind!

246
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:12,793
Yugi, what's happening?

247
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:14,136
Oh, no, the Trinity.

248
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,660
It's in the class of Exodia.

249
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:18,950
Whoa!

250
00:14:21,300 --> 00:14:23,418
Elements of thunder, water and wind.

251
00:14:23,700 --> 00:14:25,680
Sui-Chi-Sanga-Kazaji begin.

252
00:14:26,180 --> 00:14:28,077
Meld your powers in eternal life.

253
00:14:28,160 --> 00:14:30,513
Show these fools your unstoppable might.

254
00:14:30,740 --> 00:14:31,900
Here it comes.

255
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:33,700
What is it? I don't know.

256
00:14:34,460 --> 00:14:36,225
He is paid beyond description.

257
00:14:36,560 --> 00:14:39,037
He'll mark the graves
with your inscription.

258
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:39,960
Gate Guardian.

259
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:53,260
You can't possibly win!

260
00:14:53,680 --> 00:14:55,915
It has the strength of three monsters.

261
00:14:56,040 --> 00:14:57,746
Yeah, each three guys in one.

262
00:14:58,200 --> 00:15:00,376
We're never getting out of this maze.

263
00:15:00,520 --> 00:15:03,480
Now what do they do? I
don't know. This looks bad.

264
00:15:04,100 --> 00:15:05,980
Don't be so downbeat, Bakura.

265
00:15:06,260 --> 00:15:08,997
If they don't beat them, we'll
never get out of the labyrinth.

266
00:15:09,080 --> 00:15:11,492
Tristan, thanks for cheering me up, mate.

267
00:15:11,580 --> 00:15:14,297
So, think you can beat us
with your big multiple guy?

268
00:15:14,380 --> 00:15:15,537
Well, we're not giving up.

269
00:15:15,620 --> 00:15:17,220
Let's go. Bring it on.

270
00:15:17,680 --> 00:15:18,860
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha.

271
00:15:19,060 --> 00:15:20,240
You must be mad.

272
00:15:20,500 --> 00:15:22,717
No one's ever gotten
past the Gate Guardian.

273
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:26,557
He is composed of three parts, each
controlling an elemental force.

274
00:15:26,640 --> 00:15:28,837
You'll never get past his combined power.

275
00:15:28,920 --> 00:15:32,038
You will wander the labyrinth,
lost for all eternity.

276
00:15:32,500 --> 00:15:35,177
Me and Yu-Gi will take
on anything that you got.

277
00:15:35,260 --> 00:15:36,920
Joey's right. We're a team.

278
00:15:37,180 --> 00:15:39,356
You'll never beat our combined power.

279
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:40,920
Take your turn. Ha!

280
00:15:41,800 --> 00:15:45,580
I told you to take me to Mokuba,
not on a tour. It's endless.

281
00:15:46,220 --> 00:15:49,691
These tunnels are honeycombed
throughout the entire island.

282
00:15:49,780 --> 00:15:53,157
Without me to guide you, you could
get lost down here for years.

283
00:15:53,240 --> 00:15:54,680
Don't get any ideas.

284
00:15:55,300 --> 00:15:58,980
Listen, Slim, I'm much bigger
and much stronger than you are.

285
00:15:59,440 --> 00:16:03,780
You only got the jump on me because
you snuck up and took me by surprise.

286
00:16:04,260 --> 00:16:08,319
What's to stop me from spinning
around right now and knocking your...

287
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:11,357
Try it and I'll drop you where you stand.

288
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:12,270
Well,

289
00:16:12,353 --> 00:16:13,217
when you put it that way,

290
00:16:13,300 --> 00:16:17,712
nothing would please me more than to
reunite you with your brother, Mokuba.

291
00:16:19,500 --> 00:16:21,180
You promised, Seto.

292
00:16:21,380 --> 00:16:24,220
You promised you'd never
let anyone separate us.

293
00:16:24,580 --> 00:16:29,220
Even at the orphanage, when all the
other boys were being adopted one by one.

294
00:16:29,540 --> 00:16:36,200
Some parents wanted you, said you were a
genius, but you refused to go without me.

295
00:16:36,900 --> 00:16:37,730
Thank you!

296
00:16:37,813 --> 00:16:39,131
That could have been you!

297
00:16:39,420 --> 00:16:44,185
But you said we weren't leaving the
orphanage until we could both leave together.

298
00:16:44,380 --> 00:16:47,800
You won't let them separate
us? Never. Don't you worry.

299
00:16:48,160 --> 00:16:49,984
No one will ever keep us apart.

300
00:16:51,300 --> 00:16:53,160
But what about Pegasus?

301
00:16:53,380 --> 00:16:55,740
You couldn't stop him from capturing me.

302
00:16:56,020 --> 00:16:58,060
Is he too much for you to handle?

303
00:16:58,640 --> 00:17:00,360
What if he's got you, too?

304
00:17:01,260 --> 00:17:02,090
Okay.

305
00:17:02,240 --> 00:17:03,920
This is as far as we go.

306
00:17:04,860 --> 00:17:05,817
Where's Mokuba?

307
00:17:05,900 --> 00:17:09,260
In Pegasus's grip, just
like you'll soon be, Kaiba.

308
00:17:09,560 --> 00:17:10,820
Stop playing games.

309
00:17:13,620 --> 00:17:14,640
The alarm.

310
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:19,657
If you want to find your brother before
reinforcements arrive, better hurry.

311
00:17:19,740 --> 00:17:21,700
Security will be here any moment.

312
00:17:22,300 --> 00:17:23,130
Mokuba.

313
00:17:24,460 --> 00:17:26,017
I've got to get him out of here.

314
00:17:26,100 --> 00:17:27,159
Away from Pegasus.

315
00:17:30,700 --> 00:17:32,620
Sir Kimo has reported in.

316
00:17:32,780 --> 00:17:35,817
It seems Seto Kaiba has
been spotted in the tunnels.

317
00:17:35,900 --> 00:17:39,480
Once again, Croquet, you
report what I already know.

318
00:17:40,120 --> 00:17:42,040
I beg your pardon, Master.

319
00:17:42,220 --> 00:17:44,573
You can beg later when you are punished.

320
00:17:45,140 --> 00:17:49,199
Seto Kaiba's presence on the island
was not part of my original plan.

321
00:17:49,900 --> 00:17:54,060
But perhaps I can turn this to
my advantage and my amusement.

322
00:17:55,980 --> 00:17:58,100
Mokuva! Mokuva! Seto!

323
00:17:58,380 --> 00:17:59,820
My brother's here!

324
00:18:00,120 --> 00:18:01,560
It's your turn, Yugi!

325
00:18:01,980 --> 00:18:03,597
Attack that big ugly log!

326
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:07,562
Nothing in my deck is powerful
enough to attack the Gate Guardian.

327
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:09,800
I can only play these.

328
00:18:10,600 --> 00:18:12,220
What a waste of a turn.

329
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:16,739
You're frightened, for all your
monsters are too weak to attack ours.

330
00:18:17,020 --> 00:18:19,520
Gate Guardian, use your immense power.

331
00:18:19,860 --> 00:18:21,097
Attack Flame Swordsman.

332
00:18:21,180 --> 00:18:22,886
Eliminate him from the field.

333
00:18:24,840 --> 00:18:25,900
This is it, bud.

334
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:27,765
We're going down in a big way.

335
00:18:29,180 --> 00:18:30,415
Thunderstroke attack!

336
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:34,360
Plane Swordsman is about to flame out.

337
00:19:02,660 --> 00:19:04,320
Go, go, go, go, go.
